      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suspect this problem occurs because EM stays alive long enough after fru-device/gpio-presence exit to finish a rescan. One possible reason is that the dbus-sensors units order themselves after EM (e.g. [the ADC sensor service]), so EM\u0027s shutdown may wait for them, while fru-device and gpio-presence have no such ordering.\n\nAlso, EM configs may probe objects from other services, so ordering EM after a fixed set of services may not cover all cases. I\u0027m not sure service file ordering alone fully addresses the issue and would like to hear other opinions.\n\n[the ADC sensor service]: https://github.com/openbmc/dbus-sensors/blob/393c0f71be63cc59b8c345126ed53c99a333ecec/service_files/xyz.openbmc_project.adcsensor.service#L6",
      "revId": "f7941e032fb7b75389d5d776500a02d2e3687652",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
